<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="DeepFake-AI Antigravity" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="diag_EfficientNetArchitecture" name="EfficientNetArchitecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1320" pageHeight="800" background="#0a0f1d" math="1" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="node_2" value="&lt;b&gt;High-Res Query Face&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Input Image&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Resolution: 3 x 380 x 380&lt;br&gt;• Normalized (ImageNet stats)&lt;br&gt;• Compound Resolution Scaling&lt;br&gt;• Captures subtle GAN pixel blurs&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#38bdf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[[B, 3, 380, 380]]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="240" width="230" height="240" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_3" value="&lt;b&gt;Multi-Stage MBConv Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Inverted Residuals &amp;amp; Linear Bottlenecks&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Stage 1 (Stem):&lt;br&gt;    Conv2d(3→32, k=3, s=2, p=1, bias=False)&lt;br&gt;    BatchNorm2d(32) + SiLU (Swish: x · σ(x))&lt;br&gt;• Stage 2 (Expansion &amp;amp; Depthwise):&lt;br&gt;    Conv2d(32→64, k=3, s=2, p=1, bias=False)&lt;br&gt;    BatchNorm2d(64) + SiLU&lt;br&gt;• Stage 3 (Deep Feature Extraction):&lt;br&gt;    Conv2d(64→128, k=3, s=2, p=1, bias=False)&lt;br&gt;    BatchNorm2d(128) + SiLU&lt;br&gt;• Preserves gradient backpropagation across deep layers&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#818cf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[MBConv Hierarchy]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="310" y="160" width="420" height="420" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_4" value="&lt;b&gt;Spatial Pooling Module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Global Feature Aggregation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Adaptive Average Pooling:&lt;br&gt;    AdaptiveAvgPool2d((1, 1))&lt;br&gt;• Channel Dimension Reduction&lt;br&gt;• Flattening: R^[B, 128]&lt;br&gt;• Invariant to Face Pose Variations&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#c084fc;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[f_effnet ∈ R^128]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#c084fc;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="770" y="220" width="260" height="300" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_5" value="&lt;b&gt;Forensic Classifier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Binary Output&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Dropout(p = 0.40)&lt;br&gt;• Linear(128 → 2)&lt;br&gt;• Real vs Synthetic Softmax&lt;br&gt;• Low Latency: 2.1ms&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#34d399;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[Softmax]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#062e1e;strokeColor=#34d399;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1070" y="240" width="210" height="260" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_6" value="128-D" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#c084fc;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#c084fc;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_4" target="node_5"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>